  "welcome": "<div class=\"landing\">\n<section class=\"hero\">\n<div class=\"hero-copy\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">\n<span class=\"tiny-line\"></span>SMALL CIRCLES. REAL CONNECTION.\n                </div>\n<h1>\n                    A little less screen.\n                    <br>\n                    A little more <em>hello.</em>\n</h1>\n<p>\n                    A phone of their own. A circle you trust.\n                    <br>\n                    Give your kids the freedom to call their favorite people, with you close by.\n                </p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\">\n<a class=\"button large\" href=\"/accounts/login/\">Log in to your family <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a>\n<a class=\"text-button\" href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"form-note\">FrontPorch is invite only for now. Any family already here can invite yours. Open your email invitation to get started.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-proof\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6Z\"/><path d=\"m8 12 3 3 5-6\"/></svg> Parent-approved. Private by design.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hero-stage\">\n<div class=\"stage-heading\">\n<span>YOUR FAMILY’S FRONT PORCH</span>\n<span><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"10\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"/></svg> Your little corner</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"phone-preview\">\n<div class=\"preview-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.4 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.8.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z\"/></svg></div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">A FAMILIAR PLACE TO CALL</div>\n<h2>A place for hello.</h2>\n<div class=\"preview-people\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"avatar lavender\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M3 21v-3a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3M16 5a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m2 4a5 5 0 0 1 3 4v2\"/></svg></span>\n<span>Friends</span>\n<small>The circle you choose</small>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"avatar yellow\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 3h14v18H5a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h14M3 19V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 14a3 3 0 0 1 6 0\"/></svg></span>\n<span>Grandparents</span>\n<small>A familiar voice</small>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"avatar blue\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 10 9-7 9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z\"/><path d=\"M9 21v-8h6v8\"/></svg></span>\n<span>Family</span>\n<small>Always in their corner</small>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"preview-footer\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 3 8 3v6c0 5-8 9-8 9s-8-4-8-9V6Z\"/><path d=\"m8 12 3 3 5-6\"/></svg> Only the people you’ve approved</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stage-note\">\n<span>More “can you come over?”</span>\n<span>Less scrolling.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stage-caption\">\n                    Good old-fashioned connection.\n                    <br>\n                    A thoughtful new way to get there.\n                </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"how-section\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>Make room for real conversations.</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"how-grid\">\n<article>\n<span class=\"step-label\">01 / AT HOME</span>\n<h3>Start with your family.</h3>\n<p>Add your children and reserve their phones. Your installer connects the hardware.</p>\n</article>\n<article>\n<span class=\"step-label\">02 / IN GOOD COMPANY</span>\n<h3>Choose their circle.</h3>\n<p>Connect with families you know. Calling starts when both families approve.</p>\n</article>\n<article>\n<span class=\"step-label\">03 / JUST PICK UP</span>\n<h3>Let the hellos happen.</h3>\n<p>A simple phone, trusted contacts, and room for conversations without a screen.</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>"
